    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d600">

                <pb facs="1278" n="1266" sameAs="frus:frus1945v02/pg1266"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">840.4016/8–245: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Czechoslovakia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Steinhardt</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract]<anchor n="65" xml:id="d600-f1"/>
                    </seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Praha</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-08-02T20:00:00+02:00">August 2, 1945—8
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received August 3—9 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>144. At lunch yesterday with President Benes he referred to the minority problem.
                    He said he understood necessity for a schedule <pb facs="1279" n="1267"
                        xml:id="pg1267"/> in connection with evacuation and that Sudeten Germans
                    must be treated humanely. He pointed out, however, the imperative necessity that
                    they be removed from Czechoslovakia as soon as possible. He said the position of
                    Czech Government would be materially strengthened if American Government would
                    “formally agree in principle” to the evacuation from Czechoslovakia of the
                    German-Hungarian minorities observing that the Russian Government has already
                    given its formal consent.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Steinhardt</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
